{"id":"641379","name":"烤面筋","author":"雪玥美食家","authorId":"12929721","desc":"","cover":"images/641379/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"谷朊粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"粗辣面","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"细辣面","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"孜然粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"花椒粉","amount":"1小匙"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温水，加盐，倒入谷朊粉，搅拌均匀，倒掉多余水分，盖保鲜袋醒发一小时。","img":"images/641379/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"醒好，按平，切条。","img":"images/641379/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用筷子从一头夹紧，边卷边扯。","img":"images/641379/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"来回收一下，两头收紧，取下来。","img":"images/641379/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里加水，烧至微开，下入卷好的面筋。","img":"images/641379/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一直保持不开的状态，煮到浮起。","img":"images/641379/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出过凉水。","img":"images/641379/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"粗辣面，细辣面，白芝麻，花椒面，盐，孜然粉，全部调料准备好。","img":"images/641379/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加少许生抽，搅拌均匀，主要是怕炸糊，这部可以不加。","img":"images/641379/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"泼热油。","img":"images/641379/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/641379/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"面筋穿上签子。","img":"images/641379/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"旋转切行状。","img":"images/641379/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拉长。","img":"images/641379/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蘸沾料。","img":"images/641379/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"烤箱200度烤15分钟。","img":"images/641379/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"面筋这样做，你是不是在也不想出去去买了。","img":"images/641379/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}